{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "1d81b1e31420ba41088fe95bcd8746aa644482a6df71b811980096ef6e7f176e",
  "bundle_request_count": 21,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:06b349b55fcc244e341aaf9f64b3cbb3a34fbd0be54d5afcc9c3bf2ee6c21519",
      "request_id": "06b349b55fcc244e341aaf9f64b3cbb3a34fbd0be54d5afcc9c3bf2ee6c21519",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "aace4a476483fa962fdaa22aa8b0cde9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上海输完，他说接下来只打巴黎。十月十六号，他改了主意，接下巴塞尔的外卡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5d561139f61250fe6d4bff9539614ff8a66ebae388ac161d3c9ba865c714d495",
      "words_sha256": "9df648defb4ec0babc14b3a08041600f28912ebd5fe6f8530f0c3a130c6966c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0da263d422bfd6466ae7a3bb6285a01f401a75e79449d241dc939fff815d0772",
      "request_id": "0da263d422bfd6466ae7a3bb6285a01f401a75e79449d241dc939fff815d0772",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6754a05763823c9e09687dd1c6db249a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那是他十五年没去过的赛场。二零零九年，就在费德勒的家乡，他在决赛赢了费德勒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0d8a377c8647d4304f175a1e12dbc19f803f510221750ae1ffca0e3cbfe7a994",
      "words_sha256": "79ea71d5498949b7ac354d00e931c808cf468964405e0fef239a1c45d405766f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:166083c86154d24664e9d7a84ab7b04161e9ad60d79e2a3b533a540f2847e084",
      "request_id": "166083c86154d24664e9d7a84ab7b04161e9ad60d79e2a3b533a540f2847e084",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f06d85325115a95060e5ab1e84599976",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二轮，胡尔卡奇。此前八次交手，德约全胜。这一次，四比六、三比六，一盘都没拿到。上海四冠王，这回只带走十个积分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c22418f97a9e1bf9774233b46e81bc468e6960f034f5035162184609b6c93d04",
      "words_sha256": "1892df951928ba9bcf7e754d745bb1a40af9f372a291e1cce7c035e275f0d656"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:27683cd9e58a6a6af3e5420c04374c45251cec6ad1c0e23ec2ec995a865514ee",
      "request_id": "27683cd9e58a6a6af3e5420c04374c45251cec6ad1c0e23ec2ec995a865514ee",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8ae53c7ca78db319377688776062fdf3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一个上海，二十岁的霍达尔一路打进决赛。他先赢一盘，离冠军只差两分，还是被达维多维奇·福基纳逆转。可这个亚军，值六百五十分。北京之后还坐在门里的德约，就这样被挤到了门外。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bccc49baf27ee334e8da21bdd957ed6b05f13b288c1c07bfcec12494229e3015",
      "words_sha256": "7b1e2a784d7d12141592222457f52f657431db117258c2328d88c00d181d50d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2c1e9560f743ffb8b0162d2c625bc7cbcf4c5c3c086311b0400a8ab9c3cdac4c",
      "request_id": "2c1e9560f743ffb8b0162d2c625bc7cbcf4c5c3c086311b0400a8ab9c3cdac4c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ce4218b5254353e20e8c7ab93843d1b1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从二零零七年起，十九个赛季，他十八次拿到这张门票，只缺了肘伤的二零一七年。十八次，和费德勒并列历史最多。可二零二四、二零二五年，他入围了，又都退了出来。今年，他想再回去一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9812fbf3641258ce610fc8ccb9383d6c245208353870bceed95f2477825337d4",
      "words_sha256": "ad93d3e62ff4de90bf2e29ab50ee8d6a33b0acb4304a3b25e1b1fda9ddf9db10"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2dda472392e0de687d35528e41e375cda2b2817497912aa473e741161614ddf3",
      "request_id": "2dda472392e0de687d35528e41e375cda2b2817497912aa473e741161614ddf3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "87dcad610c7a0268904f0de0cf0af40f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七座年终总决赛冠军，历史最多。三年后，三十九岁的他，站在了门外。辛纳伤停报销，入围线降到第九。坐在门里最后一个位置的，是二十岁的霍达尔，三千一百五十九分。德约，差三百一十九。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7246a97a4ebcaa5c66a95262cb57b5a1da9417644822c18ce5a9dae9d75d4808",
      "words_sha256": "fe993d9bdb3615c61f774e071349972c881e1bec051c1c8181f78105e01f0923"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5393940024505fe944aa7c467412d0a5e204cf2dfd78767a21ff9090dda6a8a0",
      "request_id": "5393940024505fe944aa7c467412d0a5e204cf2dfd78767a21ff9090dda6a8a0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c87ae292a131033cf9f95f898760fc65",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘刚开局，德米纳尔大腿受伤，只打了一局就退赛。三十九岁夺冠，比他年纪更大的冠军，要追到一九七七年，四十三岁的罗斯沃尔在香港登顶。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0c930c85a8ec11730826c3aaa4b2a0c99b3a9e9957de96a716eeab24532e5739",
      "words_sha256": "557c68d970aaddfa6956555d021bbdd8fbf02c8e15dc390301a7e01bcf60f7fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:67688eb67e6ffcf2e91f755aae3df79e5ce70b7e66532bd609060c22add56d3e",
      "request_id": "67688eb67e6ffcf2e91f755aae3df79e5ce70b7e66532bd609060c22add56d3e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "57bc9762b034bcb8cc4e919926ec7eb3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七座奖杯，没有一张门票是送的。门票不认名字，只认积分。十一月八号巴黎落幕，三十九岁的他，还能不能拿到第十九张？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "821530a483577f0f187a22ae66bf1bdfc5c556cc48da7d6318e1a5d3057416fc",
      "words_sha256": "bd7cd7450187cf711252179293a98f2810f49aeb29fc404ffa7401bbde1ce970"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8330d228875fd0a4f7c4864990145cbeef890d94588307fb3a77234deb9cbbce",
      "request_id": "8330d228875fd0a4f7c4864990145cbeef890d94588307fb3a77234deb9cbbce",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "94c60b2ef42b8be82e3e2e44afb1c4a8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九月美网，第一轮出局。上次大满贯首轮输球，还是二零零六年。世界排名，掉到了第十二。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6ee971d1b7114b562071ad40d26fa61b9bd0c927f5d2f172f02a5d6630728145",
      "words_sha256": "fe36b8f5993b17171873e033596509ed322048409893c96696a5008a44e616b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8738f6cbfbbdc83a7e49a9feb75b0d04444db4862f029f808f84429b1ea8e2f6",
      "request_id": "8738f6cbfbbdc83a7e49a9feb75b0d04444db4862f029f808f84429b1ea8e2f6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1d10dac682bc32347ce75b27999a02c1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "霍达尔，也在巴塞尔的签表里。追的人和被追的人，同一周，同一块场地。巴塞尔冠军五百分，最后一站巴黎，一千分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "43f34fe563811f40d0b715646e4b079a0b50f8dcce9367122d0482e26a05b570",
      "words_sha256": "cbfa2a7639d8f81698cdaef18d6798fc9c0ebbee1d24f5c3d6e8d5c1f77e70c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:99f2ffcf16202ce0ea1b1793ba825de4f05ce67b0bb5e105e0b6143c85463897",
      "request_id": "99f2ffcf16202ce0ea1b1793ba825de4f05ce67b0bb5e105e0b6143c85463897",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fb9aa101986080a2de38853fada341aa",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "其实这一整年，都不像他。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "65e53abd0afbc03eb5c9d3c3d5314ee357f501cd684869b8f683edbf12fd4126",
      "words_sha256": "598526a56cb340924d6834728425b9b9f8aefe51c774c6e745567defeb0f4355"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9e087e44bd29d195cb334cf7eaecd893a60f73d0f8aa1f7f9941d92828586459",
      "request_id": "9e087e44bd29d195cb334cf7eaecd893a60f73d0f8aa1f7f9941d92828586459",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "012e425428c0ed12e0abd213a11118a0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三个星期前在北京，他三十四战全胜，拿下生涯第一百零二冠。只是这一冠赢得不痛快：半决赛，对手被取消了资格。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ab05b5d128119157bc91b7c02c8730e6ed5f7b48f00f68c501611391552ce307",
      "words_sha256": "ccab114fba22516ed0bc0f497980d4ced3e41e3b1d4ebaec56a9ed83b38c2273"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a29adfdbc33f3c265147569df5abad06761d8d526422e8081704fc1f24e3f561",
      "request_id": "a29adfdbc33f3c265147569df5abad06761d8d526422e8081704fc1f24e3f561",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2e2759e31d70645aaf39ef4d71ffd9ae",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "拿过七座总决赛奖杯，今年还在门外。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "44baa6be2c05153e1aa08746b2ccbede4ea9625510828d49b14525734f6e76b3",
      "words_sha256": "8e34509863f6b86cfdc5ad466a44791520928227a6793cc79de1864a50b64773"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ad0055276700d0e51f5e4508be729be7a83abd209153c5b578d86b4d9779dcbf",
      "request_id": "ad0055276700d0e51f5e4508be729be7a83abd209153c5b578d86b4d9779dcbf",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ab8f32d2cac6c06ce34cc4e675faefa1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一月澳网决赛，他先赢一盘，还是输给了阿尔卡拉斯。墨尔本十一次进决赛，前十次全胜，这是第一次输。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ad2f75a171e0851ac85ee86dabde936b68a4ed3ba9747b20e2fceb3e4183ef0e",
      "words_sha256": "932c767c3670265806afa870fa78f46373b47fc749296a355f7eade619be83e9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b6b701a1d35638907d942cc1327b9c71d0a6167b8365565fabd163c8f5ae1164",
      "request_id": "b6b701a1d35638907d942cc1327b9c71d0a6167b8365565fabd163c8f5ae1164",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "af22f51fce8f3da423780517f6e00b95",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "846e1dd743b2daaeca23366184ea4dee30f2d298c2d91fa759bbc96539d108cf",
      "words_sha256": "74d567be7f7803b20932324ddb499c26d9b44b49f356f71996592439089032e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:be25f4112d707ac074258827367351253afeb7d98005fc6a342d07580190112a",
      "request_id": "be25f4112d707ac074258827367351253afeb7d98005fc6a342d07580190112a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0b7f0ec9b3def10c74e85801c6322b75",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三天后，上海。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3d2b6583d094e5db83a29796216023ca0f5a6e53bb5f79cd4d78ecacbdf1817e",
      "words_sha256": "d90855aeb3c7e6740c427c6c768a1032f8f07801e5763559b21e9527c76c7ace"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:be2e6f4a8f44233282a406f704ac2cf616edb91946c09c64e3fcca5e11389309",
      "request_id": "be2e6f4a8f44233282a406f704ac2cf616edb91946c09c64e3fcca5e11389309",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b01052547dcefe07cc00a03dc8fb4ced",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "年终总决赛，一年只请积分最高的八个人。二零零八年，上海，二十一岁的他，第一次站上最高处。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "35400f26a51e75cf7503ae99a9199b1fb845e5d38151b6cd721286c4d80ebf83",
      "words_sha256": "235c10dafdea7823720e117f20dd5b961d33e7d1329759f2c17174e94ba34cea"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c288a0fc1a5d06939a95b013dda6f51fef8a35d6c4586e281c327c2bd50a5f84",
      "request_id": "c288a0fc1a5d06939a95b013dda6f51fef8a35d6c4586e281c327c2bd50a5f84",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "22897fa5a5979f50ed1914fd102ff0f9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三十五岁，他又一次站上最高处。第六座，追平了费德勒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8f3019aa1c933105788046e77ca72c9d80470faca1a05dc97b3810d6c3e282bc",
      "words_sha256": "7da5c6e58ef1c23d962419ea37534156808ff8b56e05ce769920f78e1f73b30c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cd6b85354819131259b47466490d41cbc53f271ddfe63ff872c10bcd49d71545",
      "request_id": "cd6b85354819131259b47466490d41cbc53f271ddfe63ff872c10bcd49d71545",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6a8bcdb3dd947980c444569bb1927538",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一二到二零一五年，伦敦四连冠。七年之后，二零二二年，都灵。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7af0be69084d375fb8ca7be1895464612a4ee821234f30908830d28a980ace42",
      "words_sha256": "5aaccf0c19d9d37a04b6f9d6ed26f89a1c994953fb0443adaa224d85c8cfd918"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ce31eb3e85575a08dc8e15b158787eee941c34d16129e5dc9df55e3ff02c82b2",
      "request_id": "ce31eb3e85575a08dc8e15b158787eee941c34d16129e5dc9df55e3ff02c82b2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "28da5d20d17ad5b5f032b4837d869aca",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二三年，第七座，比费德勒多一座，历史第一。三十六岁，他把最年长冠军的纪录又刷新了一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bba898a0778f347479e963aa559612d715c422cffa2cc63950a140207d428244",
      "words_sha256": "03477019b29a755b34da9b31a60dad40bc0c8ec362bec05e20390eaddbce31a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d1d63c58c37a056ca57c5d904a27c77256a735e8c28c6332bfc1667ac3096e60",
      "request_id": "d1d63c58c37a056ca57c5d904a27c77256a735e8c28c6332bfc1667ac3096e60",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fdcf4b924ff9585e73a9358ce0f2d915",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可他的球，一点没打折扣。决赛第一盘二比二，他的发球局，被逼到了破发点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bcdce48f74293dd19be33f6c4d5f0c676b59b2f692ffea44c801932c4df7bf30",
      "words_sha256": "1477e0f82323c296c6e0dc4a8a66ee4b887eeca3d78c675b70a562fe47efc2da"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7246a97a4ebcaa5c66a95262cb57b5a1da9417644822c18ce5a9dae9d75d4808",
      "words_sha256": "fe993d9bdb3615c61f774e071349972c881e1bec051c1c8181f78105e01f0923",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "87dcad610c7a0268904f0de0cf0af40f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七座年终总决赛冠军，历史最多。三年后，三十九岁的他，站在了门外。辛纳伤停报销，入围线降到第九。坐在门里最后一个位置的，是二十岁的霍达尔，三千一百五十九分。德约，差三百一十九。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "35400f26a51e75cf7503ae99a9199b1fb845e5d38151b6cd721286c4d80ebf83",
      "words_sha256": "235c10dafdea7823720e117f20dd5b961d33e7d1329759f2c17174e94ba34cea",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b01052547dcefe07cc00a03dc8fb4ced",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "年终总决赛，一年只请积分最高的八个人。二零零八年，上海，二十一岁的他，第一次站上最高处。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7af0be69084d375fb8ca7be1895464612a4ee821234f30908830d28a980ace42",
      "words_sha256": "5aaccf0c19d9d37a04b6f9d6ed26f89a1c994953fb0443adaa224d85c8cfd918",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6a8bcdb3dd947980c444569bb1927538",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一二到二零一五年，伦敦四连冠。七年之后，二零二二年，都灵。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8f3019aa1c933105788046e77ca72c9d80470faca1a05dc97b3810d6c3e282bc",
      "words_sha256": "7da5c6e58ef1c23d962419ea37534156808ff8b56e05ce769920f78e1f73b30c",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "22897fa5a5979f50ed1914fd102ff0f9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三十五岁，他又一次站上最高处。第六座，追平了费德勒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bba898a0778f347479e963aa559612d715c422cffa2cc63950a140207d428244",
      "words_sha256": "03477019b29a755b34da9b31a60dad40bc0c8ec362bec05e20390eaddbce31a9",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "28da5d20d17ad5b5f032b4837d869aca",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二三年，第七座，比费德勒多一座，历史第一。三十六岁，他把最年长冠军的纪录又刷新了一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9812fbf3641258ce610fc8ccb9383d6c245208353870bceed95f2477825337d4",
      "words_sha256": "ad93d3e62ff4de90bf2e29ab50ee8d6a33b0acb4304a3b25e1b1fda9ddf9db10",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ce4218b5254353e20e8c7ab93843d1b1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从二零零七年起，十九个赛季，他十八次拿到这张门票，只缺了肘伤的二零一七年。十八次，和费德勒并列历史最多。可二零二四、二零二五年，他入围了，又都退了出来。今年，他想再回去一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ab05b5d128119157bc91b7c02c8730e6ed5f7b48f00f68c501611391552ce307",
      "words_sha256": "ccab114fba22516ed0bc0f497980d4ced3e41e3b1d4ebaec56a9ed83b38c2273",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "012e425428c0ed12e0abd213a11118a0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三个星期前在北京，他三十四战全胜，拿下生涯第一百零二冠。只是这一冠赢得不痛快：半决赛，对手被取消了资格。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bcdce48f74293dd19be33f6c4d5f0c676b59b2f692ffea44c801932c4df7bf30",
      "words_sha256": "1477e0f82323c296c6e0dc4a8a66ee4b887eeca3d78c675b70a562fe47efc2da",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fdcf4b924ff9585e73a9358ce0f2d915",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可他的球，一点没打折扣。决赛第一盘二比二，他的发球局，被逼到了破发点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0c930c85a8ec11730826c3aaa4b2a0c99b3a9e9957de96a716eeab24532e5739",
      "words_sha256": "557c68d970aaddfa6956555d021bbdd8fbf02c8e15dc390301a7e01bcf60f7fa",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c87ae292a131033cf9f95f898760fc65",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘刚开局，德米纳尔大腿受伤，只打了一局就退赛。三十九岁夺冠，比他年纪更大的冠军，要追到一九七七年，四十三岁的罗斯沃尔在香港登顶。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3d2b6583d094e5db83a29796216023ca0f5a6e53bb5f79cd4d78ecacbdf1817e",
      "words_sha256": "d90855aeb3c7e6740c427c6c768a1032f8f07801e5763559b21e9527c76c7ace",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0b7f0ec9b3def10c74e85801c6322b75",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三天后，上海。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c22418f97a9e1bf9774233b46e81bc468e6960f034f5035162184609b6c93d04",
      "words_sha256": "1892df951928ba9bcf7e754d745bb1a40af9f372a291e1cce7c035e275f0d656",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f06d85325115a95060e5ab1e84599976",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二轮，胡尔卡奇。此前八次交手，德约全胜。这一次，四比六、三比六，一盘都没拿到。上海四冠王，这回只带走十个积分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bccc49baf27ee334e8da21bdd957ed6b05f13b288c1c07bfcec12494229e3015",
      "words_sha256": "7b1e2a784d7d12141592222457f52f657431db117258c2328d88c00d181d50d5",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8ae53c7ca78db319377688776062fdf3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一个上海，二十岁的霍达尔一路打进决赛。他先赢一盘，离冠军只差两分，还是被达维多维奇·福基纳逆转。可这个亚军，值六百五十分。北京之后还坐在门里的德约，就这样被挤到了门外。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "65e53abd0afbc03eb5c9d3c3d5314ee357f501cd684869b8f683edbf12fd4126",
      "words_sha256": "598526a56cb340924d6834728425b9b9f8aefe51c774c6e745567defeb0f4355",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fb9aa101986080a2de38853fada341aa",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "其实这一整年，都不像他。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ad2f75a171e0851ac85ee86dabde936b68a4ed3ba9747b20e2fceb3e4183ef0e",
      "words_sha256": "932c767c3670265806afa870fa78f46373b47fc749296a355f7eade619be83e9",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ab8f32d2cac6c06ce34cc4e675faefa1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一月澳网决赛，他先赢一盘，还是输给了阿尔卡拉斯。墨尔本十一次进决赛，前十次全胜，这是第一次输。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6ee971d1b7114b562071ad40d26fa61b9bd0c927f5d2f172f02a5d6630728145",
      "words_sha256": "fe36b8f5993b17171873e033596509ed322048409893c96696a5008a44e616b6",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "94c60b2ef42b8be82e3e2e44afb1c4a8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九月美网，第一轮出局。上次大满贯首轮输球，还是二零零六年。世界排名，掉到了第十二。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5d561139f61250fe6d4bff9539614ff8a66ebae388ac161d3c9ba865c714d495",
      "words_sha256": "9df648defb4ec0babc14b3a08041600f28912ebd5fe6f8530f0c3a130c6966c6",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "aace4a476483fa962fdaa22aa8b0cde9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上海输完，他说接下来只打巴黎。十月十六号，他改了主意，接下巴塞尔的外卡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0d8a377c8647d4304f175a1e12dbc19f803f510221750ae1ffca0e3cbfe7a994",
      "words_sha256": "79ea71d5498949b7ac354d00e931c808cf468964405e0fef239a1c45d405766f",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6754a05763823c9e09687dd1c6db249a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那是他十五年没去过的赛场。二零零九年，就在费德勒的家乡，他在决赛赢了费德勒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "43f34fe563811f40d0b715646e4b079a0b50f8dcce9367122d0482e26a05b570",
      "words_sha256": "cbfa2a7639d8f81698cdaef18d6798fc9c0ebbee1d24f5c3d6e8d5c1f77e70c3",
      "words_path": "voice_25.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1d10dac682bc32347ce75b27999a02c1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "霍达尔，也在巴塞尔的签表里。追的人和被追的人，同一周，同一块场地。巴塞尔冠军五百分，最后一站巴黎，一千分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "821530a483577f0f187a22ae66bf1bdfc5c556cc48da7d6318e1a5d3057416fc",
      "words_sha256": "bd7cd7450187cf711252179293a98f2810f49aeb29fc404ffa7401bbde1ce970",
      "words_path": "voice_26.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "57bc9762b034bcb8cc4e919926ec7eb3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七座奖杯，没有一张门票是送的。门票不认名字，只认积分。十一月八号巴黎落幕，三十九岁的他，还能不能拿到第十九张？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "44baa6be2c05153e1aa08746b2ccbede4ea9625510828d49b14525734f6e76b3",
      "words_sha256": "8e34509863f6b86cfdc5ad466a44791520928227a6793cc79de1864a50b64773",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2e2759e31d70645aaf39ef4d71ffd9ae",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "拿过七座总决赛奖杯，今年还在门外。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "846e1dd743b2daaeca23366184ea4dee30f2d298c2d91fa759bbc96539d108cf",
      "words_sha256": "74d567be7f7803b20932324ddb499c26d9b44b49f356f71996592439089032e6",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "af22f51fce8f3da423780517f6e00b95",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
